  "opening": "<div class=\"intro\" id=\"intro\" aria-hidden=\"true\" hidden>\n    <p>minimal primitives</p>\n    <ul><li>get</li><li>put</li><li>push</li><li>turn</li><li>join</li><li>split</li><li>bend</li><li>switch</li></ul>\n  </div>",
  "header": "<header class=\"top\">\n    <h1 class=\"masthead\" id=\"masthead\"><span id=\"masthead-text\">minimal primitives</span></h1>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"gear\" id=\"gear\" aria-label=\"Settings\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"settings\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 19.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 1 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z\"/></svg></button>\n  </header>",
  "settings": "<dialog id=\"settings\" class=\"sheet\" aria-labelledby=\"settings-title\">\n    <div class=\"sheet-head\"><h2 id=\"settings-title\">Settings</h2><form method=\"dialog\"><button class=\"sheet-x\" aria-label=\"Close Settings\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button></form></div>\n    <div class=\"sheet-body\">\n      <h3 class=\"group\">Display</h3>\n      <label class=\"row\">Look <select id=\"set-look\"><option value=\"system\">Follow phone</option><option value=\"checkerboard\">Checkerboard</option><option value=\"light\">Light</option><option value=\"dark\">Dark</option></select></label>\n      <label class=\"row\">Motion <select id=\"set-motion\"><option value=\"system\">Follow phone</option><option value=\"reduce\">Reduced</option></select></label>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span>Opening</span><button type=\"button\" id=\"set-opening\">Play</button></div>\n      <h3 class=\"group\">Access</h3>\n      <label class=\"row\">Access <select id=\"set-access\"><option value=\"off\">Off</option><option value=\"switch\">One switch</option><option value=\"look\">Look and hold</option></select></label>\n      <p class=\"note\">The starting choice for each game here, until you set one in that game.</p>\n      <h3 class=\"group\">About</h3>\n      <p>Simple machines are what machines are made of: levers, wheels, ramps, wedges, screws, pulleys. Primitives are what doing is made of: get, put, push, turn, join, split, bend, switch. Each game here is built on one or two of them.</p>\n      <p>They started as a sneaky way to run motor assessments for eye gaze, head pointing and switch users. Turns out they're also just fun.</p>\n      <p><a href=\"https://github.com/lukeslp/minimal-primitives\">Source on GitHub</a>, MIT.</p>\n    </div>\n  </dialog>",
